?'done':''}">${m.done?'✓':'○'}</span><div><strong>${m.title}</strong><small>${m.detail}</small></div><span class="xp-pill">+${m.xp} XP</span></div>`).join('')}</div></section></div><section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">SUBJECT READINESS</span><h2>Where you stand</h2></div><button class="text-button" data-nav="subjects">All subjects →</button></div><div class="readiness-list">${ready.map(s=>`<div class="readiness-row"><span>${esc(s.icon)} ${esc(s.name)}</span><div class="readiness-track"><i style="width:${readiness(s)}%"></i></div><strong>${readiness(s)}%</strong></div>`).join('')}</div></section><div class="dashboard-grid bottom-grid"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">SMART REVIEW</span><h2>${due.length?`${due.length} topic${due.length===1?'':'s'} ready to revisit`:'Build lasting memory'}</h2></div><span class="panel-emoji">↻</span></div><p class="panel-copy">${due.length?'Short spaced-repetition tests help move knowledge into long-term memory.':'Complete a topic, then we’ll schedule a quick review for tomorrow.'}</p><button class="secondary-button" data-nav="revisions">Open revision queue</button></section><section class="panel boss-teaser"><div class="panel-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">WEEKLY MILESTONE</span><h2>Boss battle</h2></div><span class="panel-emoji">♜</span></div><p class="panel-copy">${Date.now()>=bossAt()?'Your weekly mixed-subject challenge is ready.':'Next battle '+fmtDate(bossAt())}</p><button class="secondary-button" data-nav="boss">${Date.now()>=bossAt()?'Enter the arena':'See battle details'}</button></section></div>`}
function subjects(){return `${header('My subjects','Track your curriculum, celebrate completed topics, and see exam readiness.','<button class="primary-button" data-action="add-subject">＋ Add subject</button>')}<div class="subject-grid">${state.subjects.map(s=>{const done=s.topics.filter(t=>t.completedAt).length,p=readiness(s);return `<article class="panel subject-card"><div class="subject-card-head"><span class="subject-symbol icon-${esc(s.color)}">${esc(s.icon)}</span><div><h3>${esc(s.name)}</h3><small>${done} of ${s.topics.length} topics studied</small></div><span class="subject-score">${p}%</span></div><div class="progress-line"><i style="width:${s.topics.length?done/s.topics.length*100:0}%"></i></div><div class="subject-card-foot"><span>Content coverage</span><span>${status(p)}</span></div><div class="topic-list">${s.topics.map(t=>`<div class="topic-item"><span class="topic-status ${t.completedAt?'complete':''}">${t.completedAt?'✓':''}</span><span class="topic-name">${esc(t.name)}</span>${t.completedAt?`<button class="soft-button" data-action="topic-test" data-topic="${esc(t.id)}">Practice</button>`:`<button class="secondary-button" data-action="complete-topic" data-topic="${esc(t.id)}">Study topic</button>`}</div>`).join('')||'<div class="topic-empty">No topics yet. Add a topic to get started.</div>'}</div><div class="subject-card-actions"><button class="soft-button" data-action="subject-quiz" data-subject="${esc(s.id)}" ${!s.topics.some(t=>t.completedAt)?'disabled':''}>Take a test</button><button class="text-button" data-action="readiness" data-subject="${esc(s.id)}">Readiness details</button></div></article>`}).join('')}</div>`}
function revisions(){const items=dueList(),due=items.filter(x=>x.overdue);return `${header('Revision queue','Spaced practice gives your learning room to stick.')}<div class="panel wide-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR RETENTION PLAN</span><h2>${due.length?`${due.length} review${due.length===1?'':'s'} due now`:'Nothing due today'}</h2></div><span class="soft-tag">${items.length} scheduled</span></div><p class="panel-copy">Reviews are scheduled 1, 3, 7, 15, and 30 days after you complete a topic. Each test is short and earns XP only when submitted.</p>${items.length?`<div class="retention-list">${items.map(x=>`<div class="retention-item"><div class="retention-date"><strong>${x.overdue?'NOW':fmtDate(x.due)}</strong><small>STEP ${x.stage}/5</small></div><div class="retention-main"><strong>${esc(x.s.name)} · ${esc(x.t.name)}</strong><small>${x.overdue?'Ready for a quick recall check':`Due ${fmtDate(x.due)}`}</small></div><button class="primary-button" data-action="revision-test" data-topic="${esc(x.t.id)}" ${!x.overdue?'disabled':''}>${x.overdue?'Start review':'Coming up'}</button></div>`).join('')}</div>`:'<div class="empty-state"><span>✦</span><h3>Great work staying current</h3><p>Complete a subject topic to start your revision schedule.</p><button class="secondary-button" data-nav="subjects">Browse subjects</button></div>'}</div>`}
function analytics(){const week=days7(),max=Math.max(1,...week.map(x=>x.m)),all=state.quizzes.filter(q=>!q.boss),avg=all.length?Math.round(all.reduce((a,x)=>a+x.percent,0)/all.length):0,topics=state.subjects.flatMap(s=>s.topics.map(t=>({s,t,qs:state.quizzes.filter(q=>q.topicId===t.id&&!q.boss)}))).filter(x=>x.qs.length),weak=[...topics].sort((a,b)=>a.qs.reduce((p,q)=>p+q.percent,0)/a.qs.length-b.qs.reduce((p,q)=>p+q.percent,0)/b.qs.length).slice(0,3);return `${header('Your progress, made visible.','Use real session and test results to guide your next study step.')}<div class="stats-grid">${stat('RECORDED STUDY TIME',minsText(sessionMins()),`${state.sessions.length} completed sessions`,'◷','lav')}${stat('TEST ACCURACY',`${avg}%`,`${all.length} submitted tests`,'✓','mint')}${stat('TOPICS COMPLETED',state.subjects.reduce((a,s)=>a+s.topics.filter(t=>t.completedAt).length,0),'Across all subjects','▤','peach')}${stat('CURRENT STREAK',`${streak()} days`,'Based on completed study sessions','✦','blue')}</div><div class="analytics-grid"><section class="panel wide-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">LAST 7 DAYS</span><h2>Time invested</h2></div><span class="soft-tag">${minsText(week.reduce((a,x)=>a+x.m,0))}</span></div><div class="bar-chart">${week.map(x=>`<div class="bar-column"><strong>${x.m?Math.round(x.m)+'m':''}</strong><div class="bar-track"><i style="height:${x.m/max*100}%"></i></div><small>${x.label}</small></div>`).join('')}</div></section><section class="panel wide-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">NEXT BEST STEPS</span><h2>Focus recommendations</h2></div><span class="panel-emoji">✧</span></div>${weak.length?`<div class="recommendation-list">${weak.map(x=>`<div class="recommendation"><strong>${esc(x.s.name)} · ${esc(x.t.name)}</strong><span>Average ${Math.round(x.qs.reduce((a,q)=>a+q.percent,0)/x.qs.length)}% — revisit the concept, then test again.</span><button class="text-button" data-action="topic-test" data-topic="${esc(x.t.id)}">Practice →</button></div>`).join('')}</div>`:'<p class="panel-copy">Submit a few topic tests and we’ll identify where targeted practice could help most.</p>'}</section></div><section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">SUBJECT BY SUBJECT</span><h2>Exam readiness breakdown</h2></div></div><div class="panel wide-panel readiness-detail-grid">${state.subjects.map(s=>`<div class="weight-item"><span>${esc(s.name)}</span><strong>${readiness(s)}% · ${status(readiness(s))}</strong><div class="progress-line"><i style="width:${readiness(s)}%"></i></div></div>`).join('')}</div></section>`}
// APP_MORE

